        "selector": {
          "type": "FragmentSelector",
          "value": "xywh=pixel:285.054931640625,359.32537841796875,2838.1484375,3775.3391723632812",
          "conformsTo": "http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/"
        }
      },
      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Folio 1r, left side (third section)",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>\n<p>[&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ] Shim[e\u02bfon] Kepha and Binyamin Altagus and three</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>[&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;to K]ephar Nah\u0323um after Yoh\u0323anan the Dyer, and they found him imprisoned for</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>often misleading the people with magic. And they took him out (of jail) and he came</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>before the governor and Yehoshu\u02bfa ben Perah\u0323iah and Marinus the elder</p>\n</li>\n<li>and the crowd. And there were with Yoh\u0323anan and Yeshu five people from</li>\n<li>\n<p>among the disciples. And Yehoshu\u02bfa and Yehudah the gardener said to Yoh\u0323anan and to Yeshu: &ldquo;Who are these</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>five who are with you?&rdquo; And Yeshu said: &ldquo;They are my disciples.&rdquo;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>And Yehoshu\u02bfa ben Perah\u0323iah said: &ldquo;What are their names?&rdquo; And they said: &ldquo;Naqai,</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>and Matai, and Buni, and Netzer and Todah.&rdquo; And Yehoshu\u02bfa ben Perah\u0323iah said to them:</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&ldquo;Indeed it is necessary for you to be executed, because you use magic.&rdquo;&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>And they were brought forward to be executed. And Naqai was brought forward first. And Naqai said: &ldquo;How</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>can you execute me, when Scripture says about me, &lsquo;and do not kill a naqi (=an innocent person) and a righteous person&rsquo;?&rdquo;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&ldquo;About you it&nbsp;was said, &lsquo;in hiding places he (i.e., the wicked man) kills a naqi (=an innocent person)&rsquo;.&rdquo;</p>\n</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
